SC,0005
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1787253511
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws            G5/41
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHarry and Meghan's return to UK
OL,4,Areignites questions over security
OL,5,
OL,6,FTheir UK security was downgraded after
OL,7,Fthey stopped being working royals in
OL,8,F2020 and moved to the US, where they
OL,9,Fhave paid for their own protection.
OL,11,FThe Royal and VIP Executive Committee
OL,12,F(Ravec), an independent body overseen
OL,13,Fby the Home Office, will now have to
OL,14,Fmake a new decision as previous
OL,15,Farrangements were based on the Sussexes
OL,16,Fnot living in the UK permanently.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
