OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Relentless' GCSE resit cycle 'simply
OL,4,Anot working', school and college
OL,5,Aleaders say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe "relentless" cycle of pupils in
OL,8,FEngland failing and then resitting
OL,9,Ftheir GCSEs in maths and English is
OL,10,F"simply not working", a leading
OL,11,Feducation union has said.
OL,13,FThe Association of School and College
OL,14,FLeaders (ASCL) said a "significant
OL,15,Fproportion" of students fall short of
OL,16,Fpassing those subjects, and that most
OL,17,Fwho retake those exams "face the
OL,18,Fmiserable experience of falling short
OL,19,Fonce again".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11907
SC,0007
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1787253511
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws            G7/41
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'Relentless' GCSE resit cycle 'simply
OL,4,Anot working', school and college
OL,5,Aleaders say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThursday's results data showed nearly
OL,8,Fone in four maths and English GCSEs in
OL,9,FEngland were taken by students aged 17
OL,10,Fand older, mostly young people
OL,11,Fresitting exams they had previously
OL,12,Ffailed.
OL,14,FThe government said it wanted to stop
OL,15,Fthe "endless treadmill of unnecessary
OL,16,Fresits".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
