OL,3,AAcademic who accused Jason Arday of
OL,4,Aplagiarism suspended by university
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn academic who accused the late
OL,7,FCambridge professor Jason Arday of
OL,8,Fplagiarism has been suspended from his
OL,9,Fpost at a Belgian university.
OL,11,FNathan Cofnas, a self-defined "race
OL,12,Frealist", was among those to question
OL,13,FArday's work and achievements -
OL,14,Fprompting a weeks-long plagiarism row
OL,15,Fprior to his death on 14 August.
OL,17,FCofnas said he was under investigation
OL,18,Fby Ghent University "for discriminating
OL,19,Fagainst Arday".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
