OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABessent urges US partners to back plans
OL,4,Ato 'squash' Iran economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Treasury secretary did not offer
OL,7,Fany insight on the measures Trump's
OL,8,Fteam is looking to implement but noted
OL,9,Fthe underlying message to US allies
OL,10,Fwill be: "You are either with us or
OL,11,Fagainst us".
OL,13,F"It is time for our allies and the rest
OL,14,Fof the world to make a decision,"
OL,15,FBessent told broadcaster CNBC.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
